StaleReportRetry
  ├── when an authenticated close report fails after the triggering deposit is cancelled
  │   └── it should remain retryable without advancing the epoch
  ├── when the failed report is retried more than 30 minutes after observation
  │   ├── it should remain failed
  │   └── it should not settle the epoch with stale TVL
  └── when a fresh report is signed with current TVL
      ├── it should settle the epoch
      └── it should not allocate previously accrued yield to the late depositor
